title: "A Bi-Directional Gated Recurrent Unit Model for Extracting Dynamic Balance Variables during Gait from a Single Inertial Measurement Unit"
abstract: "Dynamic balance (COM-COP inclination angle and its rate of change) during gait from one sacral IMU with a bi-directional GRU and a weighted MSE loss, following Yu et al. (2023), demonstrated on the public Kuopio gait data set."
